<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-VIEIRA TO MAKE DEBUT AGAINST DUTCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VIEIRA TO MAKE DEBUT AGAINST DUTCH.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arsenal midfielder Patrick Vieira will make his France debut against the Netherlands in their friendly at Parc des Princes on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Vieira was chosen on Tuesday in place of injured captain Didier Deschamps.</p>
<p>Team: 1-Bernard Lama; 15-Lilian Thuram, 5-Laurent Blanc, 8-Marcel Desailly, 3-Bixente Lizarazu; 19-Christian Karembeu, 12-Pierre Laigle, 6-Patrick Vieira, 13-Ibrahim Ba; 10-Zinedine Zidane, 11-Christophe Dugarry.</p>
</text>
